      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Hace mucho, un gran diluvio había cubierto el mundo. Por fin, el agua bajó.",
          "en": "Long ago, a great flood had covered the world. At last, the water went down."
        },
        {
          "es": "En la punta norte de Haida Gwaii hay una larga playa de arena, llamada Rose Spit.",
          "en": "At the northern tip of Haida Gwaii, there is a long beach of sand, called Rose Spit."
        },
        {
          "es": "El Cuervo caminaba por ahí, solito. Estaba aburrido, buscando algo nuevo.",
          "en": "Raven was walking there, all alone. He was bored, and looking for something new."
        }
      ],
