      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Entonces salió una carita. Y después otra. Tenían demasiada curiosidad para quedarse adentro.",
          "en": "Then one little face came out. Then another. They were too curious to stay inside."
        },
        {
          "es": "Una por una, salieron de la almeja a la arena.",
          "en": "One by one, they climbed out of the clamshell onto the sand."
        },
        {
          "es": "No tenían plumas ni pelo. Se paraban en dos piernas, parpadeando a la luz.",
          "en": "They had no feathers and no fur. They stood on two legs, blinking in the light."
        },
        {
          "es": "Eran los primeros haida, la primera gente.",
          "en": "These were the first Haida, the first people."
        },
        {
          "es": "Si hubieras estado dentro de esa almeja, ¿habrías salido?",
          "en": "If you had been inside that shell, would you have come out?"
        }
